    "ds": {"scale": 0.6, "offset": [0, 0]},
    "_note": "Clarity-style upscaler — SD1.5 + ControlNet Tile + TiledDiffusion. Two-path design: original image → ControlNet tile conditioning (spatial reference); 4x ESRGAN + 0.5x scale → VAEEncodeTiled → TiledDiffusion KSampler (24 steps, CFG 6, dpmpp_2m/karras, denoise 0.30) → VAEDecodeTiled → net ~2x with diffusion detail. FreeU_V2 (1.3/1.4/0.9/0.2) boosts SD1.5 detail sharpness. ~15-25s on 4090. Default checkpoint: Realistic_Vision_V5.1_fp16-no-ema.safetensors (identity-preserving, original Clarity-style). Swap to DreamShaper_8_pruned.safetensors for more creative/aggressive enhancement. Default upscaler: 4xLSDIR.pth (swap to 4x-UltraSharp.pth, 4x_NMKD-Siax_200k.pth, 4x_foolhardy_Remacri.pth, or 4xNomos8kDAT.pth in UpscaleModelLoader). ControlNet strength 0.65 (original Clarity spec). Bundle: HUGGINGFACE_MODELS=clarity_bundle"
